consult-org-roam NEWS -- history of user-visible changes.

This is the news of e8-consult-org-roam, the E8 port of
consult-org-roam.  'C-h P' shows it under the package's description.


* Changes in consult-org-roam 0.1.0

This is the first release, a port of consult-org-roam 0.1.  It needs
E8 0.3.1 or newer, e8-consult and e8-org-roam.

** 'consult-org-roam-mode' reads org-roam's nodes with a preview.
'org-roam-node-find', 'org-roam-node-insert' and every other command
that reads a node show each node in the window as it is moved to.

** 'consult-buffer' lists the open notes by title, in a group.
'n' and 'SPC' narrow to the group.  'consult-org-roam-buffer-enabled',
'consult-org-roam-buffer-narrow-key' and
'consult-org-roam-buffer-after-buffers' change it.

** 'consult-org-roam-backlinks' chooses among the notes linking here.

** 'consult-org-roam-forward-links' chooses among this note's links.

** 'consult-org-roam-file-find' chooses among the file nodes.
With 'C-u', it and the two commands above visit the node in another
window.

** 'consult-org-roam-search' searches the notes' text as you type.
'consult-org-roam-grep-func' says whether with "consult-grep" or
"consult-ripgrep".
